 English.\n\n\n## Includes\n\n- Private Guided Walking Tour\n- Professional Tour Guide\n- Duration 2.5 Hours\n\n\n## Excludes\n\n- Tour price does NOT include hotel pickup or drop-off (we recommend UBER or Taxi)\n- Tour price does NOT include gratuities (optional)\n- Tour is NOT available for those with walking disabilities or using a wheelchair", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "#**TOUR IN ENGLISH**\n\n# IMPORTANT Before you go:\n\n- Please arrive at the **designated meeting point 10 minutes prior** to your tour start time. Please note : All **latecomers risk missing the tour**.\n- We ask that all guests **bring identification** (with age indicated). \n- Please do not bring any oversized bags, or personal items larger than a small backpack \n- This tour runs everyday rains or shine, please dress accordingly\n\n**Wheelchair tour only available as PRIVATE** (guide will not be able to provide a small group tour for guests that require wheelchair)\n\n# ***10% OFF*** with code: [***BABYLON10***](https://babylontours.com)\n\nBenefit of 10% discount in over 10 destinations world wide for any tour of your choice (gift cards included) [https://babylontours.com](https://babylontours.com)\n\n---\n**Meet your guide here!**\n![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/5KhHL7MiRdm9swy3ht1p)", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "2.5 Hrs | Skip-the-line tour | Discover incredible public art hiding in plain sight", "short_description": "Discover Chicago’s striking architecture, public art, and hidden gems on a 2.5 hour private guided stroll through the city’s heart.", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/babylontours-chicago/items/490685/images/1039031/", "pk": 1039031, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/pZxaNv2TR2C2PxwAZ